#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_frederich_beforelecture
msgid "Class is about to begin, please sit down. I will accept questions after the lecture is over."
msgstr "곧 수업을 시작합니다. 자리에 앉아주세요. 질문은 강의가 끝난 뒤 받겠습니다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena
msgid "Ah, this deer soup smells just heavenly."
msgstr "아, 이 사슴 수프 냄새 정말 끝내주네."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:0
msgid "Could you sell me some traveling supplies?"
msgstr "여행 물자를 좀 팔아주실 수 있나요?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_franz1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella1:3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella0:3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_frederich_afterlecture:0
msgid "Could you tell me what you know about the library theft?"
msgstr "도서관 도난 사건에 대해 아는 걸 말해줄 수 있나요?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:2
msgid "Soup from those creepy deer? Yuck."
msgstr "그 소름 끼치는 사슴으로 만든 수프라고? 으웩."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick
msgid "He notices your presence and looks at you. His face quickly turning into a smile."
msgstr "그가 당신의 존재를 알아차리고 바라본다. 얼굴에는 금세 미소가 번진다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor7
msgid "She was my student, and like many young bakers, she aspired to make a name for herself and became a researcher. But one day, she decided to leave Brightport, and I have not heard from her since."
msgstr ""
"그녀는 내 학생이었어. 많은 젊은 제빵사들처럼 자기 이름을 알리고 싶어 했고 "
"결국 연구자가 됐지. 하지만 어느 날 Brightport를 떠나기로 했고, 그 뒤로는 "
"소식을 듣지 못했어."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor7:0
msgid "She might be my only clue to solve a problem. Is there really nothing you can tell me about her whereabouts?"
msgstr ""
"그 사람이 제 문제를 풀 유일한 단서일지도 몰라요. 어디 있는지 정말 아무것도 "
"모르세요?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor8
msgid "Hmm, it sounds like you've found yourself in some kind of argument. If it helps, she left a lot of her writings and research at my house for safekeeping. You can read through them. I hope it proves helpful."
msgstr ""
"흠, 뭔가 다툼에 휘말린 모양이군. 도움이 될지 모르겠지만, 그녀가 보관해달라며 "
"내 집에 글과 연구 자료를 많이 남겨뒀어. 읽어봐도 좋아. 도움이 됐으면 좋겠군."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_cratelockedroomguard
msgid "Where do you think you're going?"
msgstr "어디 가려고?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_key
msgid "Hmm, let me think."
msgstr "흠, 생각 좀 해보자."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor5
msgid "Yes, I have seen Brightport change. I've lived through its tumultuous times. Why do you ask, young fellow?"
msgstr ""
"그래, Brightport가 변하는 모습을 많이 봤지. 격동의 시기도 직접 겪었고. 왜 "
"묻는 거냐, 젊은이?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor5:0
msgid "I'm looking for a person who lived here a long time ago named Bryma. Have you heard of them?"
msgstr "오래전에 여기 살았던 브리마라는 사람을 찾고 있어요. 들어본 적 있나요?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor6
msgid "That's a name I haven't heard in more than 20 years! "
msgstr "20년도 넘게 듣지 못한 이름이군! "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3
msgid "Ho, ho, what resplendent blue waves."
msgstr "허허, 눈부시게 푸른 물결이로구나."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3:0
msgid "Can you please tell me that story again?"
msgstr "그 이야기 다시 한번 해주실 수 있나요?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor:1
msgid "You must have been living here for a long time, right?"
msgstr "여기서 아주 오래 사셨죠?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor4
msgid "It would be my joy, young fellow."
msgstr "기꺼이 해주지, 젊은이."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor1
msgid "During the normal time of the year, the water that flows through Brimhaven does so uninterrupted. But when the rainy season starts, the flow becomes a monstrous maelstrom, overflowing onto the plains and into the lake."
msgstr ""
"평소에는 Brimhaven을 지나는 물이 막힘없이 흐르지. 하지만 우기가 시작되면 "
"물살이 거대한 소용돌이처럼 변해 평야와 호수까지 넘쳐흐른단다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro0
msgid "Hss, speak to the leader."
msgstr "쉬익, 지도자와 이야기해."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor2
msgid "That, and the confluence of other rivers to the east, which drain into the lake, causes the water level to rise and flood the grasslands surrounding the lake. It reaches up until the foundation of the houses but never rises more than the second stair step."
msgstr ""
"거기에 동쪽의 여러 강물까지 합류해 호수로 흘러들면서 수위가 올라 주변 초원이 "
"잠겨. 집 기초까지 물이 차오르지만 두 번째 계단보다 높게 올라온 적은 없지."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor2:0
msgid "Wow, that's fascinating!"
msgstr "와, 정말 흥미롭네요!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro1
msgid "You are friend of us now."
msgstr "넌 이제 우리 친구다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor0
msgid "Do you know why the houses in Brightport that are closest to the shore of the lake, have foundations made of stone?"
msgstr "호수 가장 가까이에 있는 Brightport의 집들이 왜 돌 기초로 되어 있는지 아니?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor0:0
msgid "I don't know, why?"
msgstr "모르겠어요. 왜죠?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_chimney
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crate_failure
msgid "There doesn't seem to be anyone around."
msgstr "주변에 아무도 없는 것 같다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_charwood_shortcut2
msgid "The statue emits a slight glow"
msgstr "석상에서 희미한 빛이 난다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_s1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_n1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_sw1
msgid "Before you stands an imposing stone statue, overgrown with moss."
msgstr "눈앞에 이끼가 무성한 위압적인 돌 석상이 서 있다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard1:0
msgid "Light."
msgstr "빛."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro
msgid "Human again? Why come here, not welcome. Leave."
msgstr "또 인간? 왜 여기 왔어. 환영 안 해. 가."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyrocave1:0
msgid "I mean no harm. Bryma said your kind's been troubling her, so I came to find out why."
msgstr ""
"해치려는 뜻은 없어요. 브리마가 당신들 종족이 자기를 괴롭힌다고 해서 이유를 "
"알아보러 왔어요."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro:1
msgid "I was just out for a stroll, and you bolted like your tail was on fire. Thought I'd see what all the fuss was about"
msgstr ""
"그냥 산책 중이었는데 당신이 꼬리에 불이라도 붙은 것처럼 도망가길래 무슨 "
"일인가 따라와 봤어요."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock4_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock6_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock1_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock3_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock5_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock2_1
msgid "You rummage through the pile and find a few cooled lava rocks."
msgstr "더미를 뒤져 식은 용암석 몇 개를 찾는다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_common
msgid "Hey $playername, how is your search going?"
msgstr "안녕, $playername. 수색은 어떻게 돼가?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_common:0
msgid "I'm still looking for Andor."
msgstr "아직 안도르를 찾고 있어요."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons_gaveup
msgid "Hello, friend. It's a shame you helped our friend but couldn't help us."
msgstr "안녕, 친구. 우리 친구는 도왔으면서 우릴 돕지 못했다니 아쉽군."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons_gaveup:0
msgid "Well I'm a bit busy searching for my brother."
msgstr "형을 찾느라 좀 바빠서요."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave
msgid "Behind the planks is a cave entrance. A cold draft chills your skin."
msgstr "판자 뒤에는 동굴 입구가 있다. 차가운 바람이 피부를 스친다."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave:0
msgid "[Squeeze in through the gap.]"
msgstr "[틈 사이로 비집고 들어간다.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_s1:1
